; 46.11 - Middle Chinese to Cantonese Vowel Shift (“The Inner-Outer Flip”)
; citation: LoneWolf, from Newman, J. (1983). Cahiers de Linguistique Asie Orentale XII.1:65 – 79.
; Relevant changes occurring before the shift:
a / ɔ / _{ŋ,k}
uə yə / ɔ œ / _{n,t}
ə / ∅ / i_{ŋ,k}
∅ / ə / C[+ labiovelar]_i
∅ / ə / _u
V / Vː / _#
; The actual vowel shift:
ə / a
a / {aː,ə}
ə / a / _{i,u}
iəu / au
a / aː / _{i,u}
a / ə / i_u
ə / ∅ / i_u
; Other relevant changes occurring at the same time:
ə / ∅ / W_
W / ∅ / C_